title: 'Fix template builds: generate-bags runtime-benchmarks and alloy-trie 0.9.9'
doc:
  - audience: Node Dev
    description: |
      `generate-bags` now has a `runtime-benchmarks` feature. The umbrella `runtime-benchmarks`
      feature enables it. Before this change, a node that used the umbrella `node` and
      `runtime-benchmarks` features did not compile. `pallet-staking-async` did not get
      `runtime-benchmarks`, but its dependencies did.
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      `pallet-revive` now compiles with `alloy-trie` 0.9.9. That release adds a public field to
      `HashBuilder`. `pallet-revive` now uses the defaults for the `HashBuilder` fields that it
      does not set.
crates:
  - name: generate-bags
    bump: patch
  - name: polkadot-sdk
    bump: patch
  - name: pallet-revive
    bump: patch
